    "input": "2019\n100",
    "output": "1 | Ravi Rossi | $125.7 M | $75.9 M | $49.8 M | Baseball | 2019\n2 | Marco Brandt | $114.2 M | $95.8 M | $18.4 M | Tennis | 2019\n3 | Tariq Moreau | $102.9 M | $49.8 M | $53.1 M | Tennis | 2019\n4 | Marco Tanaka | $88.6 M | $37.7 M | $50.9 M | Soccer | 2019\n5 | Kofi Lindqvist | $88.4 M | $36.9 M | $51.5 M | Boxing | 2019\n6 | Nadia Tanaka | $86.3 M | $66.2 M | $20.1 M | Football | 2019\n7 | Ravi Moreau | $68.6 M | $63.6 M | $5 M | Tennis | 2019\n8 | Marco Lindqvist | $53 M | $33.5 M | $19.5 M | Tennis | 2019\n9 | Elena Okafor | $31 M | $28.2 M | $2.8 M | Golf | 2019\n10 | Hana Mensah | $24.8 M | $24.5 M | $300 K | Baseball | 2019",
